        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 2001, Spring Loaded Plunger Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA Plunger Door Stop like this one mounts to the lower surface of the door to keep it in an open position when activated. The Spring Loaded Plunger Door Stop is an easy to use, no hand door stop--just push the plunger down with your foot to activate then press the release tab to inactivate. This Plunger Door Holder is available with a polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 2001 Plunger Door Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 7-1/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Gap to Floor: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Color: White</li>\r\n<li>Package includes: a non-skid rubber tip to protect the floor and mounting hardware.</li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Limited quantities available. (This item is discontinued) </b>\r\n</p>",
